# Paths deleted from the vendored subcharts after `helm dependency update`.
# One path per line, relative to this chart directory. Comments with #.
#
# The upstream crossview chart ships helm-unittest suites written against its
# own defaults (bundled postgres, database on). Our values turn the database
# off, so those suites fail when helm-unittest runs this chart with its
# subcharts, as CI does. The published tarball carries them regardless, which
# is why this file exists: without it they come back on the next version bump.
charts/crossview/tests
